 "source": "Service announcements of the NX60i board (firmware v1.4.3, observed 2026-11-02): service types and versions, channel and register ids, names and types as the board sends them, kept whole so that fake_xcore announces what the board announces. Enum values (except the emergency bit names), function parameters and return types are left out because no tool reads them.",
